渡江，求珪，得之，問其本，曰；「汝南人也。」浚戲之曰：「吾固疑吳無君子，而卿果吾鄉人。」","display_wrapper_start":0,"display_wrapper_end":0,"raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-7903772-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"浚","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"069明顗為安東將軍浚子；本061同父官與三子顗嵩謨脈絡合，與042伐吳周浚亦同事件。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"蔡敏","kind":"person","person_id":"jkg_s0j_gg4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"珪","kind":"person","person_id":"exa_xgn_wyq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"敏","kind":"person","person_id":"jkg_s0j_gg4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"弟","kind":"person","person_id":"jkg_s0j_gg4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"珪","kind":"person","person_id":"exa_xgn_wyq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"浚","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"069明顗為安東將軍浚子；本061同父官與三子顗嵩謨脈絡合，與042伐吳周浚亦同事件。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"浚","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"069明顗為安東將軍浚子；本061同父官與三子顗嵩謨脈絡合，與042伐吳周浚亦同事件。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p004:m0131","start":131,"end":132,"surface":"珪","kind":"person","person_id":"exa_xgn_wyq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_n